            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in SwapMac 0.3.4</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fits a half-screen window:</b> snap SwapMac to one side of the screen and Details closes by itself, so the page keeps its width. Select something and it opens again.</li>
<li><b>Details only where it's useful:</b> it appears on the Dashboard, Explained, Map, Large Files and search, and no longer takes room on screens with nothing to select.</li>
<li><b>Cleaner narrow layouts:</b> the Overview and Dashboard cards wrap and stack instead of squeezing their numbers.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
