        <item>
            <title>0.3.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:42:15 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in SwapMac 0.3.2</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Full Disk Access stays on after updates:</b> until now, macOS turned it off with every update. Please turn it on one last time: in System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Full Disk Access, remove SwapMac with the − button, add it again with +, then reopen SwapMac. From this version on, it stays on.</li>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> after reopening SwapMac without Full Disk Access, the window could get stuck with an empty sidebar and the top of the page out of reach.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
